{
  "id": "canva-content-pipeline",
  "title": "Content Pipeline",
  "description": "Tile: Content Pipeline - Canva. Shows how much content is moving through one Canva folder broken into four inferred stages -- Draft, In Review, Ready to Post, Posted -- plus a per-design list. Canva's Connect API has no content-calendar/status field at all, and a tile's dataProvider can only fire one MCP call on mount, so every stage is INFERRED from two real signals every design object actually has (created_at/updated_at), not read from any Canva field. The tile no longer shows an on-card disclaimer banner about this, NOR the Eyebrow subtitle that repeated the same caveat (both removed at the user's request, 2026-09-09) -- the inferred-not-live-schedule-data caveat now lives only in this description, not in front of the end viewer. Removing the Eyebrow is a deliberate deviation from TILE-DISPLAY-STANDARDS.md §9's every-tile-gets-an-Eyebrow-below-its-Heading rule -- flagged, not silently dropped. Classification (see canva_pipeline_stage in this plugin's widget-elements for the exact thresholds): a design barely touched since creation (<1hr edit span) is Draft; one edited within the last 2 days is In Review; one with real edit history that's gone quiet for 2-14 days is Ready To Post; one untouched for 14+ days is assumed Posted/live. Each row's dimensions come from Canva's own thumbnail width/height (a preview raster, CONFIRMED via a live harness call against a real account on 2026-09-09 to NOT be the design's true canvas size -- e.g. a real response returned 596x335, not a round canvas preset) and its content-category tag (e.g. 'social') is a best-effort keyword match against the design's title, omitted rather than guessed when nothing matches. dataProvider's folder_id is 'root' (Canva's real top-level Projects folder, confirmed live) -- FULL PIPELINE VERIFIED LIVE against a real connected account on 2026-09-09 (dataProvider + all 10 canva_* widget-elements functions run end-to-end with no errors). Original design intent was a folder_id pointing at a DEDICATED 'Content Pipeline' project folder, the same 'must be passed explicitly, per-tenant' pattern already established for project_key/service_desk_id on this connector's Atlassian sibling plugin -- but no such folder exists in the account this was verified against, so 'root' is used as a working stand-in so the tile is genuinely live-testable now, not a placeholder. Swap folder_id to a real dedicated folder's ID once the team creates one (and re-verify -- a dedicated folder likely has a different mix of edit histories than root's QA-test designs). KNOWN DATA ARTIFACT, not a bug: every design in the account this was verified against classifies as Draft (7/7, 100%) -- each was edited only briefly within ~25 minutes of creation and never touched again, which correctly falls under the <1hr-edit-span rule. Expect a flat single-bucket chart until real, varied edit histories exist.",
  "category": "marketing",
  "tags": ["canva", "design", "content", "pipeline", "marketing", "editorial", "social"],
  "keywords": ["content pipeline", "content calendar", "design status", "draft", "in review", "ready to post", "posted", "social media content"],
  "connectorsUsed": ["canva"],
  "popularity": 0,
  "status": "draft",
  "sizing": {
    "preferred": { "colSpan": 5, "rowSpan": 9 },
    "min": { "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 7 },
    "max": { "colSpan": 9, "rowSpan": 14 }
  },
  "dataProvider": {
    "mcp": "canva",
    "tool": "list_folder_items",
    "params": {
      "folder_id": "root",
      "item_types": ["design"],
      "sort_by": "modified_descending",
      "limit": 50
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "root": "card",
    "elements": {
      "card": {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["header", "body"]
      },

      "header": {
        "type": "Header",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["headerRow"]
      },
      "headerRow": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "start", "justify": "between" },
        "children": ["titleGroup", "countBadge"]
      },
      "titleGroup": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "start" },
        "children": ["titleIcon", "titleStack"]
      },
      "titleIcon": {
        "type": "Icon",
        "props": { "name": "FolderKanban", "tone": "accent", "size": "sm" }
      },
      "titleStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "none" },
        "children": ["title"]
      },
      "title": {
        "type": "Heading",
        "props": { "text": "Content Pipeline", "level": "h2" }
      },
      "countBadge": {
        "type": "Badge",
        "props": {
          "text": {
            "$computed": "fmt",
            "args": {
              "pattern": "{n} designs",
              "n": {
                "$computed": "canva_active_design_count",
                "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" } }
              }
            }
          },
          "tone": "muted",
          "variant": "soft"
        },
        "visible": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items/0" }
      },

      "body": {
        "type": "Body",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["loading", "empty", "content"]
      },

      "loading": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "sm" },
        "children": ["sk1", "sk2", "sk3", "sk4"],
        "visible": { "$state": "/_loading/canva.list_folder_items" }
      },
      "sk1": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk2": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk3": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk4": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },

      "empty": {
        "type": "Empty",
        "props": { "message": "No designs found in the Content Pipeline folder." },
        "visible": {
          "$and": [
            { "$state": "/_loading/canva.list_folder_items", "not": true },
            { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items/0", "not": true }
          ]
        }
      },

      "content": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "md" },
        "children": ["bucketStack", "listDivider", "designList"],
        "visible": {
          "$and": [
            { "$state": "/_loading/canva.list_folder_items", "not": true },
            { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items/0" }
          ]
        }
      },

      "bucketStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "xs" },
        "children": ["bucketDraft", "bucketInReview", "bucketReady", "bucketPosted"]
      },

      "bucketDraft": { "type": "Stack", "props": { "gap": "xs" }, "children": ["bucketDraftRow", "bucketDraftBarRow"] },
      "bucketDraftRow": { "type": "Row", "props": { "justify": "between" }, "children": ["bucketDraftLabel", "bucketDraftVal"] },
      "bucketDraftLabel": { "type": "Text", "props": { "text": "Draft", "size": "sm" } },
      "bucketDraftVal": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_stage_count", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "stage": "draft" } },
          "size": "sm", "weight": "medium"
        }
      },
      "bucketDraftBarRow": { "type": "Row", "props": {}, "children": ["bucketDraftBar"] },
      "bucketDraftBar": {
        "type": "ProgressBar",
        "props": {
          "value": { "$computed": "canva_stage_pct", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "stage": "draft" } },
          "tone": "info"
        }
      },

      "bucketInReview": { "type": "Stack", "props": { "gap": "xs" }, "children": ["bucketInReviewRow", "bucketInReviewBarRow"] },
      "bucketInReviewRow": { "type": "Row", "props": { "justify": "between" }, "children": ["bucketInReviewLabel", "bucketInReviewVal"] },
      "bucketInReviewLabel": { "type": "Text", "props": { "text": "In review", "size": "sm" } },
      "bucketInReviewVal": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_stage_count", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "stage": "in_review" } },
          "size": "sm", "weight": "medium"
        }
      },
      "bucketInReviewBarRow": { "type": "Row", "props": {}, "children": ["bucketInReviewBar"] },
      "bucketInReviewBar": {
        "type": "ProgressBar",
        "props": {
          "value": { "$computed": "canva_stage_pct", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "stage": "in_review" } },
          "tone": "info"
        }
      },

      "bucketReady": { "type": "Stack", "props": { "gap": "xs" }, "children": ["bucketReadyRow", "bucketReadyBarRow"] },
      "bucketReadyRow": { "type": "Row", "props": { "justify": "between" }, "children": ["bucketReadyLabel", "bucketReadyVal"] },
      "bucketReadyLabel": { "type": "Text", "props": { "text": "Ready to post", "size": "sm" } },
      "bucketReadyVal": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_stage_count", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "stage": "ready" } },
          "size": "sm", "weight": "medium"
        }
      },
      "bucketReadyBarRow": { "type": "Row", "props": {}, "children": ["bucketReadyBar"] },
      "bucketReadyBar": {
        "type": "ProgressBar",
        "props": {
          "value": { "$computed": "canva_stage_pct", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "stage": "ready" } },
          "tone": "info"
        }
      },

      "bucketPosted": { "type": "Stack", "props": { "gap": "xs" }, "children": ["bucketPostedRow", "bucketPostedBarRow"] },
      "bucketPostedRow": { "type": "Row", "props": { "justify": "between" }, "children": ["bucketPostedLabel", "bucketPostedVal"] },
      "bucketPostedLabel": { "type": "Text", "props": { "text": "Posted", "size": "sm", "weight": "medium" } },
      "bucketPostedVal": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_stage_count", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "stage": "posted" } },
          "size": "sm", "weight": "medium"
        }
      },
      "bucketPostedBarRow": { "type": "Row", "props": {}, "children": ["bucketPostedBar"] },
      "bucketPostedBar": {
        "type": "ProgressBar",
        "props": {
          "value": { "$computed": "canva_stage_pct", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "stage": "posted" } },
          "tone": "success"
        }
      },

      "listDivider": { "type": "Divider", "props": {} },

      "designList": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "xs" },
        "children": ["designRow"],
        "repeat": { "statePath": "/canva/list_folder_items/items", "key": "design/id" },
        "limit": 20
      },
      "designRow": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "center", "justify": "between", "hover": true, "clickable": true },
        "children": ["designStack", "designStageBadge"],
        "on": {
          "click": {
            "action": "open_url",
            "params": {
              "url": { "$computed": "canva_design_open_url", "args": { "design": { "$item": "design" } } },
              "target": "_blank"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "designStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "none", "grow": true },
        "children": ["designTitle", "designSubtitle"]
      },
      "designTitle": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": { "text": { "$item": "design/title" }, "size": "sm", "weight": "medium", "truncate": true }
      },
      "designSubtitle": {
        "type": "Caption",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_design_subtitle", "args": { "design": { "$item": "design" } } },
          "tone": "muted"
        }
      },
      "designStageBadge": {
        "type": "Badge",
        "props": {
          "text": {
            "$computed": "canva_pipeline_stage_label",
            "args": {
              "value": { "$computed": "canva_pipeline_stage", "args": { "design": { "$item": "design" } } }
            }
          },
          "tone": {
            "$computed": "canva_pipeline_stage_tone",
            "args": {
              "value": { "$computed": "canva_pipeline_stage", "args": { "design": { "$item": "design" } } }
            }
          },
          "variant": "soft"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
